<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.3600 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.3600 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3600 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Thursday after 75.5700 on Wednesday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 10		 July 9</p>
<p> High			     75.6500		 75.8000</p>
<p> Low				75.3500		 75.5400</p>
<p> Open			     75.6500		 75.8000</p>
<p> Close			    75.3600		 75.5700</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    4.885		   3.120</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
